    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>

    <h2>Not Legal Advice</h2>
    <p>
      All content on VisaPath.pk is for informational purposes only and should not be construed as legal, financial, or immigration advice. For official and current information, consult the embassy of your destination country or a licensed immigration lawyer.
    </p>

    <h2>No Affiliation</h2>
