      VisaPath.pk is not affiliated with any government, embassy, consulate, or official immigration body. All brand names, logos, and official information mentioned on this site belong to their respective owners.
    </p>

    <h2>Accuracy</h2>
    <p>
      Visa fees, processing times, and requirements change frequently. While we work to keep the site accurate, we cannot guarantee that every detail reflects the latest rules. Before applying for any visa, verify directly with the official embassy or consulate.
    </p>

    <h2>Calculator Results</h2>
    <p>
      Our calculators (Schengen days, visa fees, etc.) are provided as estimates and planning tools only. Final decisions on visa approvals, overstay, and day counts rest with immigration authorities.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
    <p>
      Some outbound links on VisaPath.pk may be affiliate links. If you make a purchase through them, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. This helps support the site. We only recommend products we believe add value.
    </p>
  </article>
